## Install terraform
1. Install dependensi
Jalankan di terminal Ubuntu WSL:
sudo apt-get install -y gnupg software-properties-common wget curl
2. Tambahkan GPG key HashiCorp
wget -O- https://apt.releases.hashicorp.com/gpg | \
gpg --dearmor | \
sudo tee /usr/share/keyrings/hashicorp-archive-keyring.gpg > /dev/null
### Pastikan file key tersedia:
ls -l /usr/share/keyrings/hashicorp-archive-keyring.gpg

3. Tambahkan repository Terraform
echo "deb [arch=$(dpkg --print-architecture) signed-by=/usr/share/keyrings/hashicorp-archive-keyring.gpg] https://apt.releases.hashicorp.com $(. /etc/os-release && echo ${UBUNTU_CODENAME:-$VERSION_CODENAME}) main" | \
sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/hashicorp.list

4. Install Terraform
sudo apt-get update
sudo apt-get install -y terraform

5. Verifikasi
terraform version
which terraform

6. Menjalankan terraform jalankan di ubuntu
terraform init
terraform validate
terraform plan
terraform apply

7. Perintah kubectl
source ~/.bashrc
echo $KUBECONFIG
kubectl get nodes